# Route: guide 25 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 46 to
# 47, 6 quests, 0.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands): Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> Angor Fortress.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Summoning the Princess (656;
# Myzrael 44); Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan Deepshadow 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

